Threat type | Likelihood | Impact | Feasibility | Risk Level
-- | -- | -- | -- | --
Casual Tracking (e.g., AirTag   hidden in a bag) | High | High | Easy | Critical
Tag Identifier Evasion (MAC   Address Randomization) | Medium | High | Medium | High
Relay Attack on Tracking Networks | Low | High | Difficult | Medium
Network-Based Tracking via Cloud   Services | Low | Medium | Difficult | Medium
Tag Disguising (Altering Physical   or Firmware Characteristics) | Low | Medium | Difficult | Medium
Jamming or Signal Interference   Attacks | Low | Low | Medium | Low



